  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2a96272b-4254-4cee-84b3-193b8206f736.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 222px;\"/></p><p>Work done during the path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4000</mn><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The work done during the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence, the total work done is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>W</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>800</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
